# Introduction

<p class="lead">This is where <strong>Llama UI</strong> and <strong>Llama Chat</strong> are designed, built and checked. Everything in it is the real component, font or file, so what you see here is what ships. The <strong>Llama Brand</strong> and the communications made with it have their own Storybook, in llama-brand.</p>

## In short

The component library **Llama UI**, built on the **Llama Brand** (the icon, Llama Sans and Llama Mono, the colours), and the app **Llama Chat** built from it, in one place, for the people and agents who design and build Llama products.

<Figure n={1} caption="The building blocks, from the bottom: the Llama Brand, in llama-brand, Llama UI built on it and Llama Chat built from that. The communications are made from the brand and the app, in llama-brand too.">
	<Stack />
</Figure>

